61" end="02:22.381">honor </span><span begin="02:22.381" end="02:23.881">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.881" end="02:29.431"><span begin="02:23.881" end="02:24.381">If </span><span begin="02:24.381" end="02:24.881">I </span><span begin="02:24.881" end="02:25.501">lose </span><span begin="02:25.501" end="02:27.131">everything </span><span begin="02:27.131" end="02:27.561">in </span><span begin="02:27.561" end="02:27.881">the </span><span begin="02:27.881" end="02:29.431">fire</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.431" end="02:35.551"><span begin="02:29.431" end="02:29.681">I'm </span><span begin="02:29.681" end="02:29.991">sending </span><span begin="02:29.991" end="02:30.431">all </span><span begin="02:30.431" end="02:30.811">my </span><span begin="02:30.811" end="02:31.611">love </span><span begin="02:31.611" end="02:32.051">to </span><span begin="02:32.051" end="02:35.551">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.881" end="03:11.491"><span begin="03:04.881" end="03:05.191">My </span><span begin="03:05.191" end="03:05.561">beating </span><span begin="03:05.561" end="03:06.381">heart </span><span begin="03:06.381" end="03:07.131">belongs </span><span begin="03:07.131" end="03:07.561">to </span><span begin="03:07.561" end="03:11.491">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:11.491" end="03:19.421"><span begin="03:11.491" end="03:12.561">I </span><span begin="03:12.561" end="03:13.181">walked </span><span begin="03:13.181" end="03:13.671">for </span><span begin="03:13.671" end="03:14.301">miles </span><span begin="03:14.301" end="03:14.741">til </span><span begin="03:14.741" end="03:15.171">I </span><span begin="03:15.171" end="03:15.681">found </span><span begin="03:15.681" end="03:19.421">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:19.421" end="03:23.721"><span begin="03:19.421" end="03:20.481">I'm </span><span begin="03:20.481" end="03:21.171">here </span><span begin="03:21.171" end="03:21.541">to </span><span begin="03:21.541" end="03:22.291">h